n  come here we treat them with respect and  have them go through the process but  obviously i believe that we need to have  borders and enforce borders in this  country all right so you're different  marijuana reform you both agree  how  i do not believe that the federal  government has been a good steward of  marijuana policy i'm speaking to you  from florida  i believe in state-based approaches  that's what our federal assistant  promises  and i hope ro connor will join me in  moving the biden administration on  marijuana because so far  the biden administration's only coherent  policy on marijuana is firing staffers  who used marijuana are you going to help  them ro i i've criticized the  administration for that i agree with  matt that that was a  wrong decision i mean we shouldn't be  firing young people who  use marijuana once and it actually has  an impact  most negatively on actually black and  brown  americans who face incarceration and  it's one of the reasons we have mass  incarceration in this country so i  agree that we ought to move towards  decriminalizing and legalizing marijuana  now hold your ears donald trump agrees  with you on the next one ro  this is bringing manufacturing back to  the u.s he deserves a lot of credit for  it matt  you're into that so is roe democrats  republicans  bring the manufacturing back what are  you doing about it  well i'm hopeful that we're able to work  together on this because it's not an  issue  that lends to a red versus blue  dynamic you see row represents silicon  valley so he knows a lot about  job creation in the modern era and i  actually think we can do a lot  in the energy space and in the clean  economy space to work right alongside  democrats to ensure that america is  splendid and wonderful for generations  to come you think america row is  willing to spend more to build it here  we need to i mean that's the real  competition with china are we going to  lead an ai are we going to lead in cyber  security  